WEBVTT

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.440
Garrick: Piett. You fool.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.420
Garrick: Get me Inferno Squad, now.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.700
Garrick: Commander Versio, report.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:53.560
Iden: We have eyes on a Rebel recovery team, Admiral, but we're too late to capture the saboteurs.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:57.440
Garrick: What is the status of the Death Star's shield generator?

00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:00.940
Iden: Worse than expected. There's no way to repair or reactivate.

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:10.040
Garrick: Then our battle station is vulnerable. Eliminate the Rebels and return to the Corvus. The Emperor's plan must not fail.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:14.520
Iden: Yes sir. Agent Hask, with me. Agent Meeko, cover us from here.
